OL,3,GNEWSALarge fire breaks out at former
OL,4,Aairfield
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large fire is being tackled at a
OL,7,Fformer airfield in Leicestershire.
OL,9,FMultiple crews are at the scene at
OL,10,FBruntingthorpe Airfield, a former RAF
OL,11,Fbase which is now used as a vehicle
OL,12,Ftest track and storage facility.
OL,14,FA spokesperson for Cox Automotive
OL,15,FEurope said its premises at the
OL,16,Fairfield was involved in the fire.
OL,18,FThere were 10 fire crews and and aerial
OL,19,Fladder platform involved, said
OL,20,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,21,Fat 10:50 BST on Friday.
